                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Trump Administration\u2019s reckless plan to shut down the Beltsville Agricultural Research Center is unacceptable. \n\nFor more than a century, BARC has been a global leader in food safety, human health, and nutrition. Closing it would devastate Maryland, undermine American agriculture, and waste generations of expertise.\n\nI stand firmly with my Maryland Delegation colleagues, local scientists, and community leaders in fighting to keep BARC open. We will not allow political games to dismantle an institution so vital to our farmers, our food supply, and our future.\n\nhttps://t.co/9iTNHfohu6",
